  "packageHash": "R37wzwdsEJieKw6KxslieCDhO5UJCR+AkhApI6+IRrom3vY3CiTF2aAcujLDnMNmzSwZwKW6vq3/t6qhNBd07w==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 275539,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/AJ-comp/Compiler",
  "published": "2026-07-02T17:36:53.13Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Add StringLiteral and CharLiteral token types (C# API: TokenType.Literal.StringLiteral / CharLiteral) whose Value is used as a raw regex without \\b wrapping, so quote-delimited tokens such as \"...\" and '.' can be lexed as single value-bearing tokens; EBNF-text token rules are not covered yet (they still lex as word patterns). Escape operator values with Regex.Escape so values containing letters or digits no longer turn into broken regex escapes. Validate terminal regex patterns at registration with a clear error instead of a crash at tokenize time, and filter LineComment-typed tokens from the parsing stream like the base Comment type.",
